<title>UK: CRICKET-SOMERSET 284 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOMERSET 284 ALL OUT V AUSTRALIA AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, England 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somerset were all out for</p>
<p>284 at tea on the first day of a four-day tour match against</p>
<p>Australia on Friday.</p>
</text>
